cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ActiStruct: Reliability-Aware Active Learning for DFT Structure Exploration"
message: "If you use ActiStruct, please cite this software."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Khandaker"
    given-names: "Md. Rifat"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0520-4654"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-15"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Rifat19R/ActiStruct"
abstract: "ActiStruct is a reliability-aware active-learning framework for
  selecting and managing Quantum ESPRESSO calculations in targeted atomistic
  structure exploration. It includes Gaussian-process and GNN-embedding
  surrogates, failure-aware acquisition, QE parsing and recovery utilities,
  append-only campaign records, a transition-metal-complex reliability
  benchmark, and a completed low-fidelity Ti3C2-O hydrogen-adsorption
  campaign. High-fidelity ranking validation was attempted and deferred; no HF
  scientific result is claimed."
keywords:
